#: code:addons/recycle_warehouse/models/warehouse.py:0
msgid ""
"A governorate is required. Order allocation matches buyers to warehouses by "
"it, so a warehouse without one holds stock that no order can ever be routed "
"to."
msgstr ""
"المحافظة مطلوبة. توزيع الطلبات يطابق المشترين بالمستودعات حسب المحافظة، "
"فالمستودع بلا محافظة يحمل مخزوناً لا يمكن توجيه أي طلب إليه."

#. module: recycle_warehouse
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/recycle_warehouse/models/warehouse.py:0
msgid ""
"An address is required. Coordinates put a pin on a map; they do not tell a "
"driver which gate, and a collection order with no address is one the buyer "
"cannot act on."
